    "date": "Uploaded 2014-10-31",
    "observation": "Central stone arch and its fanlight, present 中环广场 tablet, lateral tall shop glazing, warm red brick bed bands and shallow granite entry steps. Image read locally, no source photo included in GLB."
  },
